# Plain

No `.pagination` field: pins $page.pagination?()'s null branch on the
SAME shared list.shtml used by the paginated sections (a shared layout
must branch cleanly on both sides), and pins subpages() staying
un-windowed when ctx._pagination is null altogether -- all 3 posts must
appear, and the pagination `<p>`/prev/next/first block must be entirely
absent.
